The legal text is the Constitution of Afghanistan as published by the Ministry of Justice of Afghanistan on its
website, https://moj.gov.af/en/enforced-constitution-afghanistan (read on 29 October 2026). The page carries no
licence or copyright statement. The text is reproduced as an official publication of the ministry, with
attribution to it.

The arrangement of this repository, its tables, commit messages and tools are by Lexifina and may be
reused under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). This repository is not legal advice and not an official
publication.
